BT /F1 14 Tf 60 690 Td (Keeping bees in a city is legal in most places and needs little space.) Tj ET
BT /F1 14 Tf 60 660 Td (A single hive fits on a rooftop or a balcony of about two square metres.) Tj ET
BT /F1 14 Tf 60 630 Td (City bees often find more varied flowers than bees in farmland.) Tj ET
