BT /F2 24 Tf 60 740 Td (1. Setting Up a Hive) Tj ET
BT /F1 14 Tf 60 690 Td (Choose a spot with morning sun and shelter from strong wind.) Tj ET
BT /F1 14 Tf 60 660 Td (Face the entrance away from busy paths so bees fly above head height.) Tj ET
BT /F1 14 Tf 60 630 Td (A starter colony of about ten thousand bees costs roughly 150 dollars.) Tj ET
BT /F1 14 Tf 60 600 Td (Provide a shallow water source within ten metres of the hive.) Tj ET
endstream
