BT /F2 24 Tf 60 740 Td (2. Seasonal Care) Tj ET
BT /F1 14 Tf 60 690 Td (Spring: inspect weekly and add space before the colony outgrows the box.) Tj ET
BT /F1 14 Tf 60 660 Td (Summer: watch for swarming signs such as new queen cells.) Tj ET
BT /F1 14 Tf 60 630 Td (Autumn: reduce the entrance and feed sugar syrup if stores are low.) Tj ET
BT /F1 14 Tf 60 600 Td (Winter: leave the colony alone and only check that the hive is dry.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
