BT /F2 24 Tf 60 740 Td (3. Harvesting Honey) Tj ET
BT /F1 14 Tf 60 690 Td (A healthy hive yields about 15 kilograms of honey in a good year.) Tj ET
BT /F1 14 Tf 60 660 Td (Harvest only capped honey, and always leave enough for the winter.) Tj ET
BT /F1 14 Tf 60 630 Td (Strain the honey through a fine mesh and store it in clean sealed jars.) Tj ET
BT /F1 14 Tf 60 600 Td (Results: 80 percent of new keepers reported a successful first harvest.) Tj ET
